          "author": "Ladybird",
          "description": "Brought to you by Penguin.     \nCounting 0 to 10 helps children build number recognition and learn to count.      \nGradually progressing from 0 to 10, children will gain confidence in writing numerals and counting in sequence, as well as grouping objects and finding the missing number.      \n\nLearn with Peppa activities introduce key early learning topics, from writing and counting to emotional development, with carefully structured practice and plenty of fun activities.      \n\nLet Peppa support your little ones on their early learning adventure in Learn with Peppa.",
